nstants/header.js:2\n<a name=\"HEADER_X_AUTH_USERNAME\"></a>\n\n## HEADER\\_X\\_AUTH\\_USERNAME\nUsername header for the basic-auth perimeter.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/constants/header.ts:14  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/constants/header.js:3\n<a name=\"HEADER_X_AUTH_PASSWORD\"></a>\n\n## HEADER\\_X\\_AUTH\\_PASSWORD\nPassword header for the basic-auth perimeter.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/constants/header.ts:19  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/constants/header.js:4\n","symbols":4,"lastUsed":1795730447628},"md:packages/backend/src/dashboard-static.module.ts":{"fp":"4d850c26c83cd80ca4644003f13bdd034f450ee7d16800af9656d191849c7053","issues":[],"kind":"md","markdown":"<a name=\"DashboardStaticModule\"></a>\n\n## DashboardStaticModule\nServes the built dashboard (DASHBOARD_DIR, packages/dashboard/dist) as static assets.\n\n**Kind**: global variable  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/dashboard-static.module.ts:11  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/dashboard-static.module.js:9\n","symbols":1,"lastUsed":1795730447693},"tdata:packages/backend/src/dashboard-static.service.spec.ts":{"doclets":[],"fp":"cfd9c7e121289e9df027d9373e4a557c9ea94891bf3c70909faa363aeedb6157","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795730447671,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/dashboard-static.service.spec.ts":{"fp":"4ebd767918680b8ca5e941b4fdeef570ab8560234fa2dd260694093ed557e340","issues":["dist file not found — dist: line omitted (build first)"],"kind":"md","skipped":"no-jsdoc","symbols":0,"lastUsed":1795730447671},"tdata:packages/backend/src/dashboard-static.service.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"DashboardStaticService","longname":"DashboardStaticService","name":"DashboardStaticService","kind":"member","scope":"global","description":"Serves the prebuilt dashboard at `/` when its build output exists.\n\n`wildcard: false` registers each built file as its own exact route, so the\nAPI routes are never shadowed and only files that exist in the dist folder\nare served. Deep client routes are served via `CLIENT_ROUTE_ALIASES`.\nEverything else falls through to Nest's own 404 handler unchanged. A\nmissing dist folder logs a warning and serves no dashboard.","params":[],"meta":{"lineno":56},"order":1,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/dashboard-static.service.js:18","src":"packages/backend/src/dashboard-static.service.ts:27"},"level":0},{"id":"CLIENT_ROUTE_ALIASES","longname":"CLIENT_ROUTE_ALIASES","name":"CLIENT_ROUTE_ALIASES","kind":"constant","scope":"global","description":"Client routes of the SPA that do not map to a file in the build output and\ntherefore need an explicit alias to `index.html`. Keep this in sync with\n`packages/dashboard/src/routes/` (currently `/` and `/ip/:ip`). The build's\nindex.html itself is served at `/` by the static plugin.","params":[],"meta":{"lineno":46},"order":0,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/dashboard-static.service.js:17","src":"packages/backend/src/dashboard-static.service.ts:15"},"level":0},{"id":"DashboardStaticService#onApplicationBootstrap","longname":"DashboardStaticService#onApplicationBootstrap","name":"onApplicationBootstrap","kind":"function","scope":"instance","description":"Registers the static routes and the deep-link aliases.","memberof":"DashboardStaticService","params":[],"returns":[{"description":"Nothing.","type":{"names":["Promise<void>"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":79},"async":true,"order":2,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/dashboard-static.service.js:24","src":"packages/backend/src/dashboard-static.service.ts:36"},"level":0}],"fp":"cd8f0393a3e99090fd6fb6269a7a89374fe9e95ea5757b0d2c3a5ce8d646881e","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795730447723,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/dashboard-static.service.ts":{"fp":"dd343d9feda4c410ccf61034f4ded8cafcc0b43277d8ff8900771e26c0093ea0","issues":[],"kind":"md","markdown":"## Members\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#DashboardStaticService\">DashboardStaticService</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Serves the prebuilt dashboard at <code>/</code> when its build output exists.</p>\n<p><code>wildcard: false</code> registers each built file as its own exact route, so the\nAPI routes are never shadowed and only files that exist in the dist folder\nare served. Deep client routes are served via <code>CLIENT_ROUTE_ALIASES</code>.\nEverything else falls through to Nest&#39;s own 404 handler unchanged. A\nmissing dist folder logs a warning and serves no dashboard.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n## Constants\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#CLIENT_ROUTE_ALIASES\">CLIENT_ROUTE_ALIASES</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Client routes of the SPA that do not map to a file in the build output and\ntherefore need an explicit alias to <code>index.html</code>. Keep this in sync with\n<code>packages/dashboard/src/routes/</code> (currently <code>/</code> and <code>/ip/:ip</code>). The build&#39;s\nindex.html itself is served at <code>/</code> by the static plugin.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n<a name=\"DashboardStaticService\"></a>\n\n## DashboardStaticService\nServes the prebuilt dashboard at `/` when its build output exists.\n\n`wildcard: false` registers each built file as its own exact route, so the\nAPI routes are never shadowed and only files that exist in the dist folder\nare served. Deep client routes are served via `CLIENT_ROUTE_ALIASES`.\nEverything else falls through to Nest's own 404 handler unchanged. A\nmissing dist folder logs a warning and serves no dashboard.\n\n**Kind**: global variable  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/dashboard-static.service.ts:27  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/dashboard-static.service.js:18\n<a name=\"DashboardStaticService+onApplicationBootstrap\"></a>\n\n### dashboardStaticService.onApplicationBootstrap() ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code>\nRegisters the static routes and the deep-link aliases.\n\n**Kind**: instance method of [<code>DashboardStaticService</code>](#DashboardStaticService)  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code> - Nothing.  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/dashboard-static.service.ts:36  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/dashboard-static.service.js:24\n<a name=\"CLIENT_ROUTE_ALIASES\"></a>\n\n## CLIENT\\_ROUTE\\_ALIASES\nClient routes of the SPA that do not map to a file in the build output and\ntherefore need an explicit alias to `index.html`. Keep this in sync with\n`packages/dashboard/src/routes/` (currently `/` and `/ip/:ip`). The build's\nindex.html itself is served at `/` by the static plugin.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/dashboard-static.service.ts:15  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/dashboard-static.service.js:17\n","symbols":3,"lastUsed":1795730447827},"tdata:packages/backend/src/environment.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"AUTH_PASSWORD","longname":"AUTH_PASSWORD","name":"AUTH_PASSWORD","kind":"member","scope":"global","description":"Basic-auth credentials; enforced only when BOTH are set (both-or-neither).","meta":{"lineno":45},"order":8,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/environment.js:13","src":"packages/backend/src/environment.ts:55"},"level":0},{"id":"AUTH_USERNAME","longname":"AUTH_USERNAME","name":"AUTH_USERNAME","kind":"member","scope":"global","description":"Basic-auth credentials; enforced only when BOTH are set (both-or-neither).","meta":{"lineno":49},"order":9,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/environment.js:14","src":"packages/backend/src/environment.ts:59"},"level":0},{"id":"CACHE_DIR","longname":"CACHE_DIR","name":"CACHE_DIR","kind":"member","scope":"global","description":"Cache root; the directory is created at startup.","meta":{"lineno":53},"order":10,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/environment.js:15","src":"packages/backend/src/environment.ts:64"},"level":0},{"id":"CACHE_MAX_BYTES","longname":"CACHE_MAX_BYTES","name":"CACHE_MAX_BYTES","kind":"member","scope":"global","description":"Soft cap for the whole cache dir; oldest-used entries are evicted first.","meta":{"lineno":57},"order":11,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/environment.js:16","src":"packages/backend/src/environment.ts:68"},"level":0},