/a>\n\n## makeService(signature, streamFactory, isImage) ⇒ <code>ImageService</code>\nBuilds an ImageService with stubbed dependencies for DNA tests.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>ImageService</code> - An ImageService wired to the stubs.  \n\n| Param | Type | Default | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| signature | <code>unknown</code> |  | The file signature returned by the stubbed CLS store. |\n| streamFactory | <code>() &#x3D;&gt; Readable</code> |  | Factory opening a fresh input stream per call. |\n| isImage | <code>boolean</code> | <code>true</code> | Whether the stubbed file-type check passes. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/image/dna.spec.ts:39  \n","symbols":3,"lastUsed":1795730467494},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/image/image-signature.interceptor.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"ImageSignatureInterceptor","longname":"ImageSignatureInterceptor","name":"ImageSignatureInterceptor","kind":"member","scope":"global","description":"Rejects /image requests whose probed signature is not an image mime (runs after the signature scan).","params":[],"meta":{"lineno":40},"order":0,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/image/image-signature.interceptor.js:14","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/image/image-signature.interceptor.ts:12"},"level":0}],"fp":"98528a9c0ac67c9a4876578acff9bb3935fd3b2a09aad12a2d559bde23db5161","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795730467512,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/image/image-signature.interceptor.ts":{"fp":"68155584f21e6138b876e5d5d94e32131df21485e23e9514dc3d376cd3ecefe3","issues":[],"kind":"md","markdown":"<a name=\"ImageSignatureInterceptor\"></a>\n\n## ImageSignatureInterceptor\nRejects /image requests whose probed signature is not an image mime (runs after the signature scan).\n\n**Kind**: global variable  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/image/image-signature.interceptor.ts:12  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/image/image-signature.interceptor.js:14\