","description":"Response content-type per sharp-encodable format. `avif`/`jpg` are not\nencoder keys; formats absent from this map fall back to octet-stream.","params":[],"meta":{"lineno":45},"order":0,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/image/image.controller.js:21","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/image/image.controller.ts:27"},"level":0}],"fp":"5305db3161ec71bef4c0a73a426bd2e869e81616d441558697bb56706dfe6855","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795730467529,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/image/image.controller.ts":{"fp":"614eef012f8bd6d372da76d61b7070356958463da57ac6fed32d26b363111ce6","issues":[],"kind":"md","markdown":"## Members\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#ImageController\">ImageController</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Image routes: processor, metadata, DNA, stats and OCR (binary stream endpoints).</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n## Constants\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#SHARP_TO_MIME\">SHARP_TO_MIME</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Response content-type per sharp-encodable format. <code>avif</code>/<code>jpg</code> are not\nencoder keys; formats absent from this map fall back to octet-stream.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n<a name=\"ImageController\"></a>\n\n## ImageController\nImage routes: processor, metadata, DNA, stats and OCR (binary stream endpoints).\n\n**Kind**: global variable  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/image/image.controller.ts:45  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/image/image.controller.js:33\n<a name=\"SHARP_TO_MIME\"></a>\n\n## SHARP\\_TO\\_MIME\nResponse content-type per sharp-encodable format. `avif`/`jpg` are not\nencoder keys; formats absent from this map fall back to octet-stream.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/image/image.controller.ts:27  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/image/image.controller.js:21\n","symbols":2,"lastUsed":1795730467600},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/image/image.module.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"ImageModule","longname":"ImageModule","name":"ImageModule","kind":"member","scop