on":"Flat query parameters for `POST /model/extract` (empty; rejects junk params).","meta":{"lineno":52},"order":9,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:22","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:66"},"level":0}],"fp":"5d85e6bff6b30abd0056d9ebe7aa12e858194bbe127b6655eb8120bb3bf762c0","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795730468272,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts":{"fp":"d2a7112ed90eadbac6b01fb834a3f14d7993cb841419c5ba9438363133cc1d4f","issues":[],"kind":"md","markdown":"## Members\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#compress\">compress</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Compression codec for mesh data; <code>none</code> keeps uncompressed accessors.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#simplify\">simplify</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Lossy simplification ratio in [0, 1]; 1 (default) disables it. Values &lt; 1 force weld on.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#weld\">weld</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Weld bitwise-identical vertices (forced on when simplify &lt; 1); default on.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#to\">to</a></dt>\n<dd><p><code>glb</code>: binary container. <code>gltf</code>: self-contained JSON container with data URIs.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n## Constants\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#MODEL_MIME\">MODEL_MIME</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Only the binary glTF container; .gltf JSON with external resources is not accepted.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#boolParameter\">boolParameter</a></dt>\n<dd><p>House-standard query boolean (accepts true/false/1/0/yes/no/on/off, case-insensitive).</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#ModelOptimizeSchema\">ModelOptimizeSchema</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Flat query parameters for <code>POST /model/optimize</code>.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#ModelConvertSchema\">ModelConvertSchema</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Flat query parameters for <code>POST /model/convert</code>.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#ModelMetadataSchema\">ModelMetadataSchema</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Flat query parameters for <code>POST /model/metadata</code> (empty; rejects junk params).</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#ModelExtractSchema\">ModelExtractSchema</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Flat query parameters for <code>POST /model/extract</code> (empty; rejects junk params).</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n<a name=\"compress\"></a>\n\n## compress\nCompression codec for mesh data; `none` keeps uncompressed accessors.\n\n**Kind**: global variable  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:23  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:7\n<a name=\"simplify\"></a>\n\n## simplify\nLossy simplification ratio in [0, 1]; 1 (default) disables it. Values < 1 force weld on.\n\n**Kind**: global variable  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:27  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:8\n<a name=\"weld\"></a>\n\n## weld\nWeld bitwise-identical vertices (forced on when simplify < 1); default on.\n\n**Kind**: global variable  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:35  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:13\n<a name=\"to\"></a>\n\n## to\n`glb`: binary container. `gltf`: self-contained JSON container with data URIs.\n\n**Kind**: global variable  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:51  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:18\n<a name=\"MODEL_MIME\"></a>\n\n## MODEL\\_MIME\nOnly the binary glTF container; .gltf JSON with external resources is not accepted.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:8  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:3\n<a name=\"boolParameter\"></a>\n\n## boolParameter\nHouse-standard query boolean (accepts true/false/1/0/yes/no/on/off, case-insensitive).\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:13  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:4\n<a name=\"ModelOptimizeSchema\"></a>\n\n## ModelOptimizeSchema\nFlat query parameters for `POST /model/optimize`.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:18  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:5\n<a name=\"ModelConvertSchema\"></a>\n\n## ModelConvertSchema\nFlat query parameters for `POST /model/convert`.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:46  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:16\n<a name=\"ModelMetadataSchema\"></a>\n\n## ModelMetadataSchema\nFlat query parameters for `POST /model/metadata` (empty; rejects junk params).\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:62  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:21\n<a name=\"ModelExtractSchema\"></a>\n\n## ModelExtractSchema\nFlat query parameters for `POST /model/extract` (empty; rejects junk params).\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:66  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:22\n","symbols":10,"lastUsed":1795730468348},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/model/worker/index.ts":{"doclets":[],"fp":"e463a98a44b0772d0f4d6844ad81c2c53e4bf62bd61c024a24606b929649f1fc","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795730468272,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/model/worker/index.ts":{"fp":"b9e90abd81780ad06707702a39502a0ec111c449d3315f483624e9cb53fe7409","issues":[],"kind":"md","skipped":"no-jsdoc","symbols":0,"lastUsed":1795730468321},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/model/worker/worker.spec.ts":{"doclets":[],"fp":"271832e369332286dd54c8c61df60eb57873ac094a3ca0ada41fc9ce9db1ea69","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795730468319,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/model/worker/worker.spec.ts":{"fp":"5f0bacbb4d5017f46a6e483de37f1183bfd14dfa0d6217c64f403d7f4f83839d","issues":["dist file not found — dist: line omitted (build first)"],"kind":"md","skipped":"no-jsdoc","symbols":0,"lastUsed":1795730468321},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/builder.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"buildPdfDocument","longname":"buildPdfDocument","name":"buildPdfDocument","kind":"constant","scope":"global","description":"Builds the PDF document body as bytes. Pages are created up front so the\ntotal logical page count (including `pageBreak` segments) is known before\nany element is drawn. Fonts and images are embedded before drawing, so the\ndraw pass is fully synchronous.\n\nCoordinate convention: every `y` is a distance from the page's top edge,\nin points (1 pt = 1/72 inch). For `text` and `pageNumber`, `y` is the distance\nto the top of the first text line's em box; the baseline is at\n`pageHeight - y - size` and every line advances by `size * 1.2`. Lines, rects,\nellipses, images, fields and tables take `y` as the distance to the element's\ntop edge; `line` endpoints are absolute distances from the top.","params":[{"description":"Validated build payload.","name":"body","type":{"names":["{ pages: { elements: ({ [x: string]: any; text: string; type: \"text\"; x: number; y: number; align?: \"left\" | \"center\" | \"right\"; font?: string; size?: number; w?: number; } | { [x: string]: any; h: number; type: \"rect\"; w: number; x: number; y: number; dash?: boolean; strokeWidth?: number; } | { [x: string]: any; h: number; type: \"ellipse\"; w: number; x: number; y: number; strokeWidth?: number; } | { [x: string]: any; type: \"line\"; x1: number; x2: number; y1: number; y2: number; dash?: boolean; thickness?: number; } | { data: string; h: number; imageType: \"png\" | \"jpg\"; type: \"image\"; w: number; x: number; y: number; opacity?: number; } | { rows: (string | { [x: string]: any; text: string; align?: \"left\" | \"center\" | \"right\"; colSpan?: number; size?: number; })[][]; type: \"table\"; w: number; x: number; y: number; colWidths?: number[]; header?: boolean; } | { [x: string]: any; fieldType: \"text\" | \"checkbox\"; type: \"field\"; x: number; y: number; h?: number; value?: string; w?: number; } | { [x: string]: any; format: string; type: \"pageNumber\"; x: number; y: number; font?: string; size?: number; } | { type: \"pageBreak\"; })[]; margin: { bottom: number; left: number; right: number; top: number; }; orientation: \"portrait\" | \"landscape\"; size: \"a4\" | \"a3\" | \"a5\" | \"letter\" | \"legal\" | \"tabloid\"; }[]; embeddedFonts?: { [x: string]: any; data: string; }[]; metadata?: { author?: string; creationDate?: string; creator?: string; keywords?: string | string[]; language?: string; subject?: string; title?: string; }; }"]}}],"returns":[{"description":"The .pdf bytes.","type":{"names":["Promise<Uint8Array<ArrayBufferLike>>"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":115},"order":0,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/builder.js:94","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/builder.ts:133"},"level":0}],"fp":"532c8d8e1dcfc5bd53da69cd2377f160a0aeab38e5b9f2e2de2fc179e9a61b84","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795730468416,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/builder.ts":{"fp":"a36dfe4701c403f271d13efd5e4bd3fb0f3057ba859089511e7fc2996b9b56c4","issues":[],"kind":"md","markdown":"<a name=\"buildPdfDocument\"></a>\n\n## buildPdfDocument ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;Uint8Array&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code>\nBuilds the PDF document body as bytes. Pages are created up front so the\ntotal logical page count (including `pageBreak` segments) is known before\nany element is drawn. Fonts and images are embedded before drawing, so the\ndraw pass is fully synchronous.\n\nCoordinate convention: every `y` is a distance from the page's top edge,\nin points (1 pt = 1/72 inch). For `text` and `pageNumber`, `y` is the distance\nto the top of the first text line's em box; the baseline is at\n`pageHeight - y - size` and every line advances by `size * 1.2`. Lines, rects,\nellipses, images, fields and tables take `y` as the distance to the element's\ntop edge; `line` endpoints are absolute distances from the top.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;Uint8Array&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code> - The .pdf bytes.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| body | <code>{ pages: { elements: ({ [x: string]: any; text: string; type: &quot;text&quot;; x: number; y: number; align?: &quot;left&quot; \\| &quot;center&quot; \\| &quot;right&quot;; font?: string; size?: number; w?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; h: number; type: &quot;rect&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; dash?: boolean; strokeWidth?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; h: number; type: &quot;ellipse&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; strokeWidth?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; type: &quot;line&quot;; x1: number; x2: number; y1: number; y2: number; dash?: boolean; thickness?: number; } \\| { data: string; h: number; imageType: &quot;png&quot; \\| &quot;jpg&quot;; type: &quot;image&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; opacity?: number; } \\| { rows: (string \\| { [x: string]: any; text: string; align?: &quot;left&quot; \\| &quot;center&quot; \\| &quot;right&quot;; colSpan?: number; size?: number; })[][]; type: &quot;table&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; colWidths?: number[]; header?: boolean; } \\| { [x: string]: any; fieldType: &quot;text&quot; \\| &quot;checkbox&quot;; type: &quot;field&quot;; x: number; y: number; h?: number; value?: string; w?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; format: string; type: &quot;pageNumber&quot;; x: number; y: number; font?: string; size?: number; } \\| { type: &quot;pageBreak&quot;; })[]; margin: { bottom: number; left: number; right: number; top: number; }; orientation: &quot;portrait&quot; \\| &quot;landscape&quot;; size: &quot;a4&quot; \\| &quot;a3&quot; \\| &quot;a5&quot; \\| &quot;letter&quot; \\| &quot;legal&quot; \\| &quot;tabloid&quot;; }[]; embeddedFonts?: { [x: string]: any; data: string; }[]; metadata?: { author?: string; creationDate?: string; creator?: string; keywords?: string \\| string[]; language?: string; subject?: string; title?: string; }; }</code> | Validated build payload. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/builder.ts:133  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/builder.js:94\n","symbols":1,"lastUsed":1795730468465},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/elements.spec.ts":{"doclets":[],"fp":"76cb3b12aade3e4161dc4b4dbc8f3e20c6d4cf7fff8e2254eedcf3826f84f567","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795730468416,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/elements.spec.ts":{"fp":"a6feba5ec9e992a1a2c6ee5d721c25dda0ee28d926b5ed6b6ec8ea26f3e942f2","issues":["dist file not found — dist: line omitted (build first)"],"kind":"md","skipped":"no-jsdoc","symbols":0,"lastUsed":1795730468416},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.controller.spec.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"rawSink","longname":"rawSink","name":"rawSink","kind":"function","scope":"global","description":"Creates a Writable raw sink with `setHeader` mocks for assertions.","params":[],"returns":[{"description":"A writable with a mocked `setHeader`.","type":{"names":["Writable & { setHeader: ReturnType<typeof vi.fn>; }"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":8},"order":0,"mdaics":{"src":"packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.controller.spec.ts:10"},"level":0}],"fp":"d76767dbe94cee028347a19b5e2a6b515d04e3f6e6c3d46420b049da0e89e2e3","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795730468432,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.controller.spec.ts":{"fp":"15537ea35e00ee071ce4421c1fa3b66754bffd9f524ae9ff9b94991d8d815ffd","issues":["dist file not found — dist: line omitted (build first)"],"kind":"md","markdown":"<a name=\"rawSink\"></a>\n\n## rawSink() ⇒ <code>Writable &amp; { setHeader: ReturnType&lt;typeof vi.fn&gt;; }</code>\nCreates a Writable raw sink with `setHeader` mocks for assertions.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>Writable &amp; { setHeader: ReturnType&lt;typeof vi.fn&gt;; }</code> - A writable with a mocked `setHeader`.  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.controller.spec.ts:10  \n","symbols":1,"lastUsed":1795730468490},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/elements.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"STANDARD","longname":"STANDARD","name":"STANDARD","kind":"constant