,{"id":"PdfService#extract","longname":"PdfService#extract","name":"extract","kind":"function","scope":"instance","description":"Extracts text from an uploaded document, page by page.","memberof":"PdfService","params":[],"returns":[{"description":"The parsed metadata plus per-page text.","type":{"names":["Promise<{ format: string; metadata: { author: string; creationDate: string; creator: string; keywords: string; modificationDate: string; producer: string; subject: string; title: string; }; pageCount: number; structure: { pages: { page: number; text: string; }[]; }; text: string; }>"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":158},"async":true,"order":6,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:89","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:121"},"level":0},{"id":"PdfService#metadata","longname":"PdfService#metadata","name":"metadata","kind":"function","scope":"instance","description":"Normalized PDF metadata for an uploaded document.","memberof":"PdfService","params":[],"returns":[{"description":"Format plus the parsed properties.","type":{"names":["Promise<{ author: string; creationDate: string; creator: string; encrypted: boolean; keywords: string; modificationDate: string; orientation: \"portrait\" | \"landscape\"; pageCount: number; pageSize: { height: number; width: number; }; producer: string; subject: string; title: string; format: string; }>"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":202},"async":true,"order":7,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:128","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:164"},"level":0}],"fp":"c747f79a054a533e40f410b7a8521549b48dc00a1d9424c468739139496e91e7","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795730468607,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts":{"fp":"9ce1457995f5367d901013798d22e0cf240ea034f329b4b528b87d172f76fe43","issues":[],"kind":"md","markdown":"## Members\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#PdfService\">PdfService</a></dt>\n<dd><p>PDF feature service: builds documents, extracts text and reads metadata.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n## Constants\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#MAX_EXTRACT_PAGES\">MAX_EXTRACT_PAGES</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Ceiling on extracted pages; plenty for legitimate decks, stops crafted fan-outs.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n## Functions\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#readBody\">readBody(cls)</a> ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Opens the uploaded body, bounded by the scanner cap.\nThe scanner only opens the source when ClamAV is enabled, so the service must too.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#assertPdfSignature\">assertPdfSignature(buffer)</a> ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Signature must be %PDF; closes the renamed-image and non-PDF holes.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#isoOrString\">isoOrString(value)</a> ⇒ <code>string</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Normalizes pdf.js info dates to ISO strings (Date objects pass through toISOString).</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n<a name=\"PdfService\"></a>\n\n## PdfService\nPDF feature service: builds documents, extracts text and reads metadata.\n\n**Kind**: global variable  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:105  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:81\n\n* [PdfService](#PdfService)\n    * [.build(body)](#PdfService+build) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code>\n    * [.extract()](#PdfService+extract) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;{ format: string; metadata: { author: string; creationDate: string; creator: string; keywords: string; modificationDate: string; producer: string; subject: string; title: string; }; pageCount: number; structure: { pages: { page: number; text: string; }[]; }; text: string; }&gt;</code>\n    * [.metadata()](#PdfService+metadata) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;{ author: string; creationDate: string; creator: string; encrypted: boolean; keywords: string; modificationDate: string; orientation: &quot;portrait&quot; \\| &quot;landscape&quot;; pageCount: number; pageSize: { height: number; width: number; }; producer: string; subject: string; title: string; format: string; }&gt;</code>\n\n<a name=\"PdfService+build\"></a>\n\n### pdfService.build(body) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code>\nBuilds a PDF from the payload in-process and returns the bytes.\n\n**Kind**: instance method of [<code>PdfService</code>](#PdfService)  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code> - The .pdf bytes.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| body | <code>{ pages: { elements: ({ [x: string]: any; text: string; type: &quot;text&quot;; x: number; y: number; align?: &quot;left&quot; \\| &quot;center&quot; \\| &quot;right&quot;; font?: string; size?: number; w?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; h: number; type: &quot;rect&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; dash?: boolean; strokeWidth?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; h: number; type: &quot;ellipse&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; strokeWidth?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; type: &quot;line&quot;; x1: number; x2: number; y1: number; y2: number; dash?: boolean; thickness?: number; } \\| { data: string; h: number; imageType: &quot;png&quot; \\| &quot;jpg&quot;; type: &quot;image&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; opacity?: number; } \\| { rows: (string \\| { [x: string]: any; text: string; align?: &quot;left&quot; \\| &quot;center&quot; \\| &quot;right&quot;; colSpan?: number; size?: number; })[][]; type: &quot;table&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; colWidths?: number[]; header?: boolean; } \\| { [x: string]: any; fieldType: &quot;text&quot; \\| &quot;checkbox&quot;; type: &quot;field&quot;; x: number; y: number; h?: number; value?: string; w?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; format: string; type: &quot;pageNumber&quot;; x: number; y: number; font?: string; size?: number; } \\| { type: &quot;pageBreak&quot;; })[]; margin: { bottom: number; left: number; right: number; top: number; }; orientation: &quot;portrait&quot; \\| &quot;landscape&quot;; size: &quot;a4&quot; \\| &quot;a3&quot; \\| &quot;a5&quot; \\| &quot;letter&quot; \\| &quot;legal&quot; \\| &quot;tabloid&quot;; }[]; embeddedFonts?: { [x: string]: any; data: string; }[]; metadata?: { author?: string; creationDate?: string; creator?: string; keywords?: string \\| string[]; language?: string; subject?: string; title?: string; }; }</code> | Validated build payload. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:113  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:86\n<a name=\"PdfService+extract\"></a>\n\n### pdfService.extract() ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;{ format: string; metadata: { author: string; creationDate: string; creator: string; keywords: string; modificationDate: string; producer: string; subject: string; title: string; }; pageCount: number; structure: { pages: { page: number; text: string; }[]; }; text: string; }&gt;</code>\nExtracts text from an uploaded document, page by page.\n\n**Kind**: instance method of [<code>PdfService</code>](#PdfService)  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;{ format: string; metadata: { author: string; creationDate: string; creator: string; keywords: string; modificationDate: string; producer: string; subject: string; title: string; }; pageCount: number; structure: { pages: { page: number; text: string; }[]; }; text: string; }&gt;</code> - The parsed metadata plus per-page text.  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:121  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:89\n<a name=\"PdfService+metadata\"></a>\n\n### pdfService.metadata() ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;{ author: string; creationDate: string; creator: string; encrypted: boolean; keywords: string; modificationDate: string; orientation: &quot;portrait&quot; \\| &quot;landscape&quot;; pageCount: number; pageSize: { height: number; width: number; }; producer: string; subject: string; title: string; format: string; }&gt;</code>\nNormalized PDF metadata for an uploaded document.\n\n**Kind**: instance method of [<code>PdfService</code>](#PdfService)  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;{ author: string; creationDate: string; creator: string; encrypted: boolean; keywords: string; modificationDate: string; orientation: &quot;portrait&quot; \\| &quot;landscape&quot;; pageCount: number; pageSize: { height: number; width: number; }; producer: string; subject: string; title: string; format: string; }&gt;</code> - Format plus the parsed properties.  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:164  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:128\n<a name=\"MAX_EXTRACT_PAGES\"></a>\n\n## MAX\\_EXTRACT\\_PAGES\nCeiling on extracted pages; plenty for legitimate decks, stops crafted fan-outs.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:89  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:75\n<a name=\"readBody\"></a>\n\n## readBody(cls) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code>\nOpens the uploaded body, bounded by the scanner cap.\nThe scanner only opens the source when ClamAV is enabled, so the service must too.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code> - The body bytes, capped.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| cls | <code>NormalizedClsService</code> | Normalized request context. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:25  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:21\n<a name=\"assertPdfSignature\"></a>\n\n## assertPdfSignature(buffer) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code>\nSignature must be %PDF; closes the renamed-image and non-PDF holes.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| buffer | <code>Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;</code> | The buffered upload. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:42  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:33\n<a name=\"isoOrString\"></a>\n\n## isoOrString(value) ⇒ <code>string</code>\nNormalizes pdf.js info dates to ISO strings (Date objects pass through toISOString).\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>string</code> - The ISO string, or the stringified value for non-Date inputs.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| value | <code>string \\| Date</code> | The raw info-dict date value. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:96  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:76\n","symbols":8,"lastUsed":1795730468701},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/schema.spec.ts":{"doclets":[],"fp":"d4bab04073617dabaa13236d5e38aeff5da75166e8dfd2ebe13d457662dfaf0f","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795730468643,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/schema.spec.ts":{"fp":"0d8b36d6ea2c36b150242eb8019c049a4f1d035fb267e7fcae6dafb5617361e7","issues":["dist file not found — dist: line omitted (build first)"],"kind":"md","skipped":"no-jsdoc","symbols":0,"lastUsed":1795730468643},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/schema.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"w","longname":"w","name":"w","kind":"member","scope":"global","description":"Box width in points; required when `align` is not `left` (text wraps to it).","meta":{"lineno":46},"order":1,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/schema.js:40","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/schema.ts:53"},"level":0},{"id":"dash","longname":"dash","name":"dash","kind":"member","scope":"global","description":"Dashed outline.","meta":{"lineno":59},"order":2,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/schema.js:50","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/schema.ts:67"},"level":0},{"id":"dash","longname":"dash","name":"dash","kind":"member","scope":"global","description":"Dashed line.","meta":{"lineno":88},"order":3,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/schema.js:76","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/schema.ts:98"},"level":0},{"id":"name","longname":"name","name":"name","kind":"me