\\| &quot;notchedRightArrow&quot; \\| &quot;octagon&quot; \\| &quot;parallelogram&quot; \\| &quot;pentagon&quot; \\| &quot;pie&quot; \\| &quot;pieWedge&quot; \\| &quot;plaque&quot; \\| &quot;plaqueTabs&quot; \\| &quot;plus&quot; \\| &quot;quadArrow&quot; \\| &quot;quadArrowCallout&quot; \\| &quot;ribbon&quot; \\| &quot;ribbon2&quot; \\| &quot;rightArrow&quot; \\| &quot;rightArrowCallout&quot; \\| &quot;rightBrace&quot; \\| &quot;rightBracket&quot; \\| &quot;round1Rect&quot; \\| &quot;round2DiagRect&quot; \\| &quot;round2SameRect&quot; \\| &quot;roundRect&quot; \\| &quot;rtTriangle&quot; \\| &quot;smileyFace&quot; \\| &quot;snip1Rect&quot; \\| &quot;snip2DiagRect&quot; \\| &quot;snip2SameRect&quot; \\| &quot;snipRoundRect&quot; \\| &quot;squareTabs&quot; \\| &quot;star10&quot; \\| &quot;star12&quot; \\| &quot;star16&quot; \\| &quot;star24&quot; \\| &quot;star32&quot; \\| &quot;star4&quot; \\| &quot;star5&quot; \\| &quot;star6&quot; \\| &quot;star7&quot; \\| &quot;star8&quot; \\| &quot;stripedRightArrow&quot; \\| &quot;sun&quot; \\| &quot;swooshArrow&quot; \\| &quot;teardrop&quot; \\| &quot;trapezoid&quot; \\| &quot;triangle&quot; \\| &quot;upArrow&quot; \\| &quot;upArrowCallout&quot; \\| &quot;upDownArrow&quot; \\| &quot;upDownArrowCallout&quot; \\| &quot;uturnArrow&quot; \\| &quot;verticalScroll&quot; \\| &quot;wedgeEllipseCallout&quot; \\| &quot;wedgeRectCallout&quot; \\| &quot;wedgeRoundRectCallout&quot;; type: &quot;shape&quot;; fill?: { [x: string]: any; }; line?: { [x: string]: any; width?: number; }; rotation?: number; text?: { [x: string]: any; text: string; bold?: boolean; breakLine?: boolean; bullet?: boolean \\| { code?: string; }; fontFace?: string; fontSize?: number; hyperlink?: { slide?: number; url?: string; }; indentLevel?: number; italic?: boolean; lang?: string; strike?: boolean; subScript?: boolean; superScript?: boolean; underline?: boolean; }[]; } \\| { h: number; w: number; x: number; y: number; rows: { text: string; colSpan?: number; fill?: { [x: string]: any; }; options?: { colspan?: number; fill?: { [x: string]: any; }; margin?: number; rowspan?: number; valign?: &quot;bottom&quot; \\| &quot;top&quot; \\| &quot;middle&quot;; }; rowSpan?: number; }[][]; type: &quot;table&quot;; margin?: number; } \\| { h: number; w: number; x: number; y: number; data: string; imageType: &quot;png&quot; \\| &quot;jpg&quot; \\| &quot;gif&quot; \\| &quot;bmp&quot;; type: &quot;image&quot;; altText?: string; sizing?: { h: number; type: &quot;contain&quot; \\| &quot;cover&quot; \\| &quot;crop&quot;; w: number; }; transparency?: number; })[]; background?: { [x: string]: any; }; notes?: string; }[]; metadata?: { author?: string; company?: string; revision?: string; subject?: string; title?: string; }; theme?: { bodyFontFace?: string; headFontFace?: string; }; }</code> | Validated build payload. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pptx/pptx.service.ts:264  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pptx/pptx.service.js:214\n<a name=\"PptxService+extract\"></a>\n\n### pptxService.extract() ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;{ format: string; metadata: any; structure: { notes: string[]; slides: { index: number; part: string; texts: any[]; }[]; text: string; }; }&gt;</code>\nExtracts text and structure from an uploaded .pptx.\n\n**Kind**: instance method of [<code>PptxService</code>](#PptxService)  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;{ format: string; metadata: any; structure: { notes: string[]; slides: { index: number; part: string; texts: any[]; }[]; text: string; }; }&gt;</code> - The parsed metadata, slide texts, notes and full body text.  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pptx/pptx.service.ts:288  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pptx/pptx.service.js:233\n<a name=\"PptxService+metadata\"></a>\n\n### pptxService.metadata() ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;any&gt;</code>\nNormalized OOXML metadata for an uploaded .pptx.\n\n**Kind**: instance method of [<code>PptxService</code>](#PptxService)  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;any&gt;</code> - Format plus the parsed properties.  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pptx/pptx.service.ts:309  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pptx/pptx.service.js:249\n<a name=\"readPartsCapped\"></a>\n\n## readPartsCapped(buffer, limits) ⇒\nMaps the shared OOXML reader's cap violations to HTTP errors (413 for size, 400 otherwise).\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: The extracted package parts.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| buffer | <code>Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;</code> | The buffered upload. |\n| limits |  | Optional per-call cap overrides. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pptx/pptx.service.ts:30  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pptx/pptx.service.js:25\n<a name=\"assertHyperlinkScheme\"></a>\n\n## assertHyperlinkScheme(record)\nValidates the run-level hyperlink allowlist.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| record | <code>Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;</code> | The inspected dictionary; hyperlink lives at `record.hyperlink.url`. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pptx/pptx.service.ts:49  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pptx/pptx.service.js:38\n<a name=\"assertBuildPayload\"></a>\n\n## assertBuildPayload(body)\nRejects payloads whose serialized size or element count could exhaust memory.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| body | <code>{ layout: &quot;LAYOUT\\_16x9&quot; \\| &quot;LAYOUT\\_16x10&quot; \\| &quot;LAYOUT\\_4x3&quot; \\| &quot;LAYOUT\\_WIDE&quot;; slides: { elements: ({ h: number; w: number; x: number; y: number; chartType: &quot;line&quot; \\| &quot;bar&quot; \\| &quot;pie&quot; \\| &quot;bar3d&quot; \\| &quot;doughnut&quot; \\| &quot;area&quot; \\| &quot;scatter&quot; \\| &quot;radar&quot;; series: { labels: string[]; values: number[]; name?: string; }[]; type: &quot;chart&quot;; chartColors?: any[]; showLegend?: boolean; showValue?: boolean; title?: string; } \\| { h: number; w: numb