index. |\n| time | <code>number</code> | Frame timestamp in seconds. |\n| length | <code>number</code> | Byte length of the frame image. |\n| boundary | <code>string</code> | Multipart boundary string. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/video/multipart.ts:21  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/video/multipart.js:6\n<a name=\"writeTerminator\"></a>\n\n## writeTerminator(boundary) ⇒ <code>Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;</code>\nWrite the multipart terminator for a screenshot response.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;</code> - Terminator buffer.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| boundary | <code>string</code> | Multipart boundary string. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/video/multipart.ts:36  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/video/multipart.js:13\n","symbols":3,"lastUsed":1795730469243},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/video/schema.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"VideoProcessorSchema","longname":"VideoProcessorSchema","name":"VideoProcessorSchema","kind":"constant","scope":"global","description":"Query parameters for `/video/processor`, `/video/metadata`, `/video/dna` and `/video/stats` uploads.","meta":{"lineno":14},"order":0,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/video/schema.js:11","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/video/schema.ts:18"},"level":0},{"id":"ScreenshotSchema","longname":"ScreenshotSchema","name":"ScreenshotSchema","kind":"constant","scope":"global","description":"Query parameters for `POST /video/screenshot` (extracted JPEG frames as multipart).","meta":{"lineno":44},"order":1,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/video/schema.js:37","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/video/schema.ts:59"},"level":0},{"id":"VideoAudioSchema","longname":"VideoAudioSchema","name":"VideoAudioSchema","kind":"constant","scope":"global","description":"Query parameters for `/video/audio` (audio extraction from a video upload).\n\nReuses the audio processor 