audio extraction from a video upload).</p>\n<p>Reuses the audio processor options except <code>codec</code>, which is derived from\n<code>format</code> so an incompatible encoder/muxer pair can never be requested.\n<code>format</code> defaults to <code>mp3</code>.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n## Functions\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#parseFrames\">parseFrames(raw)</a> ⇒ <code>number[]</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Parse a comma-separated list of frame timestamps into a deduplicated,\nvalidated, sorted, and capped array of seconds.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n<a name=\"VideoProcessorSchema\"></a>\n\n## VideoProcessorSchema\nQuery parameters for `/video/processor`, `/video/metadata`, `/video/dna` and `/video/stats` uploads.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/video/schema.ts:18  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/video/schema.js:11\n<a name=\"ScreenshotSchema\"></a>\n\n## ScreenshotSchema\nQuery parameters for `POST /video/screenshot` (extracted JPEG frames as multipart).\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/video/schema.ts:59  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/video/schema.js:37\n<a name=\"VideoAudioSchema\"></a>\n\n## VideoAudioSchema\nQuery parameters for `/video/audio` (audio extraction from a video upload).\n\nReuses the audio processor options except `codec`, which is derived from\n`format` so an incompatible encoder/muxer pair can never be requested.\n`format` defaults to `mp3`.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/video/schema.ts:90  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/video/schema.js:50\n<a name=\"parseFrames\"></a>\n\n## parseFrames(raw) ⇒ <code>number[]</code>\nParse a comma-separated list of frame timestamps into a deduplicated,\nvalidated, sorted, and capped array of seconds.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>number[]</code> - Sorted unique frame timestamps in seconds.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| raw | <code>string</code> | Raw comma-separated frame string. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/video/schema.ts:74  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/video/schema.js:40\n","symbols":4,"lastUsed":1795730469278},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/video/screenshot-frames.spec.ts":{"fp":"5ca4c9381dbd5c8fe04252c3cdac4becc5b1072887cded4405ea5f4a7e41ef70","issues":["dist file not found — dist: line omitted (build first)"],"kind":"md","skipped":"no-jsdoc","symbols":0,"lastUsed":1795730469211},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/video/type.ts":{"doclets":[],"fp":"efe91f99b0cbb320bf49ebd7221f89afef49fc534e94f22bf749421b6457d760","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795730469211,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/video/type.ts":{"fp":"275f77565714a2092868998ea3f0960217bfeb0ea84962f5880f1ff01bab501f","issues":[],"kind":"md","skipped":"no-jsdoc","symbols":0,"lastUsed":1795730469250},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/video/video-signature.interceptor.spec.ts":{"doclets":[],"fp":"dbd587d343bfbfb6025545a3bb4fee26a4f3c7e9ec0093aa3092deea9aa72806","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795730469293,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/video/video-signature.interceptor.spec.ts":{"fp":"755c26575d5af47e937ffe87d18be2023dfe8f3941fe91e96f249f5af4311eb2","issues":["dist file not found — dist: line omitted (build first)"],"kind":"md","skipped":"no-jsdoc","symbols":0,"lastUsed":1795730469293},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/video/video-signature.interceptor.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"VideoSignatureInterceptor","longname":"VideoSignatureInterceptor","name":"VideoSignatureInterceptor","kind":"member","scope":"global","description":"Rejects /video requests whose probed signature is not a video mime (runs after the signature scan).","params":[],"meta":{"lineno":40},"order":0,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/video/video-signature.interceptor.js:14","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/video/video-signature.interceptor.ts:12"},"level":0}],"fp":"db6ac8f86a5a0cf26fa62