#q\">q(overrides)</a> ⇒ <code>{ [x: string]: any; maxCells: number; raw: boolean; blankrows?: boolean; skipHidden?: boolean; }</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Query defaults with overrides, mirroring the schema&#39;s post-validation shape.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n<a name=\"zipBytes\"></a>\n\n## zipBytes(sheetData) ⇒ <code>Buffer&lt;ArrayBuffer&gt;</code>\nBuilds a minimal, valid .xlsx container around the given worksheet XML.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>Buffer&lt;ArrayBuffer&gt;</code> - The packaged .xlsx bytes.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| sheetData | <code>string</code> | The raw XML placed inside <sheetData>. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/xlsx/xlsx.service.spec.ts:34  \n<a name=\"buildBytes\"></a>\n\n## buildBytes(sheets) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code>\nBuilds a workbook from the given sheets and returns the .xlsx bytes.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code> - The workbook bytes.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| sheets | <code>{ [x: string]: any; rows: (Record&lt;string, string \\| number \\| boolean \\| { [x: string]: unknown; c?: { [x: string]: unknown; a: string; t: string; }[]; f?: string; l?: { [x: string]: unknown; Target?: string; Tooltip?: string; }; t?: &quot;b&quot; \\| &quot;n&quot; \\| &quot;s&quot; \\| &quot;d&quot; \\| &quot;e&quot; \\| &quot;z&quot;; v?: unknown; z?: string; }&gt; \\| (string \\| number \\| boolean \\| { [x: string]: unknown; c?: { [x: string]: unknown; a: string; t: string; }[]; f?: string; l?: { [x: string]: unknown; Target?: string; Tooltip?: string; }; t?: &quot;b&quot; \\| &quot;n&quot; \\| &quot;s&quot; \\| &quot;d&quot; \\| &quot;e&quot; \\| &quot;z&quot;; v?: unknown; z?: string; })[])[]; cellDates?: boolean; cols?: { [x: string]: unknown; hidden?: boolean; level?: number; wch?: number; width?: number; wpx?: number; }[]; columns?: string[]; merges?: any[]; sheetVisibility?: 0 \\| 1 \\| 2; }[]</code> | The sheets to build. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/xlsx/xlsx.service.spec.ts:52  \n<a name=\"q\"></a>\n\n## q(overrides) ⇒ <code>{ [x: string]: any; maxCells: number; raw: boolean; blankrows?: boolean; skipHidden?: boolean; }</code>\nQuery defaults with overrides, mirroring the schema's post-validation shape.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>{ [x: string]: any; maxCells: number; raw: boolean; blankrows?: boolean; skipHidden?: boolean; }</code> - A full, valid extract query.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| overrides | <code>Partial&lt;{ [x: string]: any; maxCells: number; raw: boolean; blankrows?: boolean; skipHidden?: boolean; }&gt;</code> | Query fields to override over the defaults. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/xlsx/xlsx.service.spec.ts:62  \n","symbols":3,"lastUsed":1795730469990},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/xlsx/xlsx.service.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"XlsxService","longname":"XlsxService","name":"XlsxService","kind":"member","scope":"global","description":"XLSX feature service: builds workbooks and parses/metadata-inspects uploads.","params":[],"meta":{"lineno":221},"order":12,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/xlsx/xlsx.service.js:131","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/xlsx/xlsx.service.ts:209"},"level":0},{"id":"MAX_RECORDS","longname":"MAX_RECORDS","name":"MAX_RECORDS","kind":"constant","scope":"global","description":"Maximum number of row records `/xlsx/extract` returns (defense-in-depth with the maxCells census).","params":[],"meta":{"lineno":47},"order":0,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/xlsx/xlsx.service.js:20","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/xlsx/xlsx.service.ts:22"},"level":0},{"id":"XLSX_TOTAL_UNCOMPRESSED","longname":"XLSX_TOTAL_UNCOMPRESSED","name":"XLSX_TOTAL_UNCOMPRESSED","kind":"constant","scope":"global","description":"Total uncompressed byte ceiling for xlsx archives; ~3.5x tighter t